SUMMARY:Continuation lines introduced by a horizontal tab
DESCRIPTION:The fold below inserts a tab rather than a space\, which
	 is the other linear white-space character the standard permits.
COMMENT:A tab fold and a space fold appear in this one value\, so
	 an unfolder must accept both.
  And a space fold ends it.
